        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sarah Paulson, Chris Messina, Rich Sommer, Alexie Gilmore, Natalie Gold, Maryann Plunkett\n- TV Series: American Horror Story, Studio 60 on the Sunset Strip\n- Episodes: Blood Bath\n- Films: Fairhaven\n- Organizations: FX, NBC, Golden Globe Awards\n\nFacts:\n- From 2006 to 2007, Sarah Paulson played Harriet Hayes in the NBC comedy-drama series Studio 60 on the Sunset Strip.\n- Sarah Paulson received her first Golden Globe Award nomination for her role in Studio 60 on the Sunset Strip.\n- Blood Bath is the eighth episode of the anthology television series American Horror Story.\n- Blood Bath premiered on FX on December 3, 2014.\n- Blood Bath was the first episode of American Horror Story that series veteran Sarah Paulson missed since the show's beginning.\n- The film Fairhaven stars Sarah Paulson, Chris Messina, Rich Sommer, Alexie Gilmore, Natalie Gold, and Maryann Plunkett.",
